 *
 * Layout:  <NXLABS_MIRROR_DIR>/files/<sha256[0:2]>/<sha256>     (immutable blobs)
 *          <NXLABS_MIRROR_DIR>/img/<aa>/<sha256>.webp           (cached images)
 *          <NXLABS_MIRROR_DIR>/tmp/                             (in-flight downloads)
