/**
 * Bedrock Dedicated Server (Mojang) — Linux zip.
 *
 *   GET https://net-secondary.web.minecraft-services.net/api/v1.0/download/links
 *       → { result:{ links:[ { downloadType:"serverBedrockLinux"|"serverBedrockPreviewLinux"|…, downloadUrl } ] } }
 *
 * DECISION (documented in docs § "Minecraft server-software mirror"): BDS is
 * distributed by Mojang under the Minecraft EULA + Privacy Policy, and every
 * BDS download page states the download is for running a server — not for
 * re-distribution. We mirror it ONLY as an internal cache for our own
